WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.930
All right, it's time for the 
regional tournament final match!

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.330
Laugh or cry, this is it!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.090
The last battle!

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.740
Certainly, until just a little while ago...

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.410
I know! If I left here...

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.930
I'm sure Misaki would fill in...

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.860
I would never fight a guy

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.650
who ran away, even once.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.940
Final turn!

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.900
F-Final turn, you say?!

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:45.310
I ride Blazing Flare Dragon!

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:54.370
I activate Blazing Flare Dragon's skill.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.550
When your opponent's card has 
been moved to the Drop Zone,

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:00.250
the Dragon's power increases by 
+3000 until the end of the turn.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.120
What?!

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.580
I attack with Blazing Flare!

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.870
N-No! I can't defend myself!

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.460
Twin drive check.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.050
First...

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:12.110
Second...

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:16.220
Got a double critical trigger!

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:28.560
But while watching Kai's fight, 
I've finally realized...

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:34.600
I wanna be as strong as you,
 and challenge you to a fight again!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:38.950
And yet, here I was, only thinking 
about losing or running away...

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.030
That doesn't do any good!

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.660
The third match of the regional 
championship final fight...

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.180
Let's start!

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.920
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.810
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.960
All right, it's the final match 
of the regional tournament!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.630
Team Handsome versus Team Q4!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.870
The last battle has begun!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.120
The outcome of this match decides which 
team will go to the national tournament!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.180
This, the final fight of 
the regional tournament!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.490
Which team is gonna go to nationals?!

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:57.930
Do your best, Aichi.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.830
Please! Don't make me marry Nagisa!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:02.690
Yeesh.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.060
Okay, Team Handsome and Team Q4,

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:10.020
surprisingly enough, this third match 
is also part of the Wedding Fight.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.340
No, it's not!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:16.380
You're so cute when you're 
embarrassed, Kamui!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.520
In the second match, we had Granblue 
versus Dragon Empire Kagero Army.

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:25.660
And Ka-boom got a good thrashing...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.750
Oh, I beg your pardon.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:29.790
1,000 sea urchins!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.700
Ka-boom...

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.140
What kind of battle are we going 
to see in this final match?!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:38.290
Expectations can't help 
but run high for this one!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:43.300
Rematch in the Final Match!!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.560
My turn, and I draw!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.900
I ride the Little Sage, Marron!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:58.110
Barcgal moves to the rear-guard circle!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:04.000
And then I use Barcgal's 
skill to call Flogal!

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.120
That's it.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.560
It's Gouki's turn.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.740
I've played him once before...

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:19.840
My only chance rides on this 
damage trigger check...

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.680
I lose.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:36.170
I know exactly what your level of play is.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.580
And it's not high enough to beat me.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.230
It's my turn, and I draw.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.990
Here I go! I ride...

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.140
Dandy Guy, Romario!

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:56.200
I use Guiding Zombie's skill to 
move it to the rear-guard circle!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.670
I call Samurai Spirit!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.340
I call Rough Seas Banshee!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.340
But that's not all.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:09.520
There's a Granblue unit here, so 
I can use the Banshee's skill.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:12.060
I put Banshee in the Soul...

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.010
and draw one card.

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:18.810
What's with these trifling moves?

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.490
Trifling...?

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:25.400
Well, after all, he calls a unit out and 
then sends it to the Soul right away...

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.380
It may be trifling to you...

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:32.600
But with the skill he just used, his Soul 
increases without taking anything away from his hand.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.710
And increasing his Soul here means...

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.080
he's lining up his sights for 
something a little later on.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.480
Here I go!

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.870
With a boost from Samurai Spirit...

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.340
Guiding Zombie powers up...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.490
and attacks Marron!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.170
Damage trigger check!

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:59.010
Next, Romario attacks Marron!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.340
Drive check!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.940
Damage trigger check!

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.790
2 damage out of the blue...

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.120
That ends my turn.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.450
Big brother, go, go!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.710
Just a little more, and then 
I'll get to marry Kamui!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:22.710
Brother, I'm counting on you! 
The rest of my life is at stake!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.390
It <i>is</i> Gouki, after all.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.030
But...

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:34.650
But I decided not to run away!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.560
Not from this place...

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.650
And not from my feelings!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.980
So...

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:43.530
I'll show you...

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.530
how I can change!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:54.360
With Barcgal's skill, I call the 
Future Knight, Llew, from my deck!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.130
And then, I use Llew's Counterblast!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:00.830
Llew goes to the Soul!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:05.220
Barcgal and Flogal move to the Soul too!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.570
Come forth, Blaster Blade!

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.020
Stand up, my avatar!

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:17.050
Superior Ride, Blaster Blade!

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:23.290
So he used Barcgal and Llew's skills 
together to bring out Blaster Blade...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.980
Isn't this the first time Aichi has 
done that kind of combination maneuver?

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.570
It seems like he's kind of fired up.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.690
He's different from last time...

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.590
I call the Knight of Silence, 
Gallatin, Wingal, and Marron!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.160
Yes!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.030
What do you think about that?!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.980
Aichi's made small moves too, but 
now his units are all lined up!

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.820
But he doesn't have any grade 3s out there!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.050
Would you stop talking nonsense?!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.600
I attack Romario with Marron!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.090
Damage trigger!

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.610
Blaster Blade...

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.820
attacks Romario!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.620
Drive trigger!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.120
I got heal trigger!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.020
I add +5000 to the power of Gallatin!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.410
And then I heal 1 point of damage!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.900
Damage check!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.420
Critical trigger!

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.720
I give the power to Romario!

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:43.620
I attack your Romario with 
Gallatin, boosted by Wingal!

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:46.890
I defend with Rick the Ghostie!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.190
I end my turn.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.930
Looks like you've improved since last time.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.710
But you haven't caught up yet!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:10.850
At the bottom of the deep blue sea, where even 
sunlight doesn't reach, there are undead pirates!

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.860
I ride Captain Nightmist!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:22.050
It's here! Nightmist, the one 
that plagued me last time!

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:27.670
I resurrect Captain Nightmist!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.530
Pirates can be resurrected 
any number of times.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:34.070
From the Drop Zone, with a Counterblast?

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.130
Here it comes at last, 
Gouki's killer pattern...

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.600
Infinite Resurrection Hell!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:47.450
If he activates that maneuver, 
there's no escape!

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.160
I call Ruin Shade!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.990
And then I call Evil Shade!

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.730
Ruin Shade attacks Blaster Blade!

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.530
I activate Ruin Shade's skill!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:08.370
I put two cards from my deck into 
the Drop Zone to add +2000 power!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.690
I also activate Nightmist's skill!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:14.650
When did he...?!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.130
Just now, Ruin Shade called him for me...

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:23.530
Another Nightmist is in the Drop Zone, 
so during my turn, he gains +3000 power!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.420
Is this the same maneuver he did last time?!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:33.630
He combined Ruin Shade's skill with 
Nightmist to power Nightmist up?!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.970
You'll rue the day you recklessly 
opposed the pirates!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.170
Aichi...

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:06.000
That Gouki person seems 
to be really strong...

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.520
I hope you're gonna be okay...

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.160
He'll be fine, Miss Emi!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:14.560
Your brother is fighting for Kamui 
the Great. There's no way he'll lose!

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.290
NW, yo!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.710
For "Kamui the Great"? I 
don't know about that...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:23.030
Exactly! Who would fight on behalf 
of that snotty little brat?!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.710
Right! He's fighting for the tea...

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.770
Aichi's acting as my 
proxy in this tournament.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.980
Well, anyway...

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:35.670
It's an important Vanguard fight, but 
regardless of who wins and loses,

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:39.640
Just cheer on your brother, 
who's fighting as hard as he can!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.850
That's what matters the most.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:41.960
Yep! Yep!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.820
Right?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.700
Yeah!

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:47.350
Do your best, Aichi!

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.430
It's still early in the fight.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:54.840
That being said, I can see he hasn't 
made it to the nationals for nothing.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.130
All right, this fight is really heating up!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:05.140
The pirates that have even disembarked 
at nationals are about to wreak havoc!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:11.110
Give him a taste of your blade, Ruin Shade!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.770
Damage trigger check!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.800
Evil Shade gives a boost!

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:21.900
Here I go!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.640
I activate Evil Shade's skill!

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.870
I put the top two cards from 
my deck into the Drop Zone...

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:31.850
and then I add +4000 power 
to my Vanguard, Nightmist!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.170
Drive check!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.340
Damage trigger check!

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.820
H-He's strong...

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.560
Wow...

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.660
That Nightmist is like a ninja, right?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:59.600
Oh, you mean like ninja 
"mist", where they don't actually disappear?

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.730
What a shame... If only it were a grade 3...

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:03.780
<i>That's</i> what you're thinking about?!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:07.430
The grade 3 obsession is alive and well!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.190
Grade 3 obsession...

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.910
G3O, yo.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.790
Not unexpected, from someone who has 
experience playing at nationals...

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.090
He's good, isn't he?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.160
Brother, please do your best!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:24.610
At this rate, I'm gonna be 
tied up like a box and fan!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:29.310
Oh! You mean "tied to a ball and chain"!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:33.060
Gouki really is an incredibly 
strong player...

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.260
But...

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:35.540
But...

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:39.670
I have to beat this strong opponent!

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:00.860
Everyone...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.220
That's right. Right now, I'm with friends...

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:10.070
If we fight together, I know we can win!

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:23.520
For the sake of my friends in Team Q4, too...

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.290
I swear...

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:29.680
I swear I'll win!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.120
<i>Now</i> he's motivated!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.760
I can tell his attitude 
is "win it for the team"!

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.170
What are you, a psychic?

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.080
Sorry. I forgot you sucked at
 reading your surroundings.

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.040
I can read my surroundings
 just fine, thank you!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.930
Let's see, my surroundings
 is mostly air...

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:50.610
so it's about 8 parts
 nitrogen, 2 parts oxygen...

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.470
You actually remember
 the composition of air.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.470
I don't think that'll cut the mustard.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.790
And to prove it, I'll give 
you another point of damage!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.560
Samurai Spirit boosts...

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.820
Guiding Zombie, who attacks!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.790
I'm not gonna let him do any more damage!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.900
I guard with the Future Knight, Llew!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:19.610
I still gave you 2 damage.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.910
That's the end of my turn.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.820
Hmmm...

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:24.620
What is it?

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:28.000
Something about that boy looks 
different from before...

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:29.440
You're right.

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.780
I know, right?!

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.760
Fine, you're right.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.220
It's my turn!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.760
I draw!

00:16:39.780 --> 00:16:40.680
Here I go!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.600
Enter the fray, King of all Knights!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:46.770
I ride the King of Knights, Alfred!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:51.800
Yesss! It's Alfred!

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.700
If Brother wins with this...

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:03.940
Kamui! I love you!

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:09.000
I beg you, Alfred! Cut off this 
string with your holy sword!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:14.010
Look! Aichi's gonna start attacking!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.250
Marron, go to the back!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.090
Okay!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.560
Alfred's Counterblast!

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:24.190
I summon a grade 2 or lower 
Royal Paladin from the deck!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.520
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:31.610
Yeah!!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.570
It's like the knights are gonna 
try to subjugate the pirates!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.050
Well, he's got a grade 3 out!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:38.720
He'll get by.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.120
He'll <i>get by</i>?!

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.700
I power up Gallatin with Wingal's boost!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.920
He attacks Nightmist!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.520
No guard!

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.310
Damage check!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.440
Fellow Royal Paladins...

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:01.580
Lend me your strength as soldiers!

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.310
No guard!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.000
Twin drive...

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.260
First check!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.120
Second check!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.820
Feel the mighty power of the holy sword!

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.910
Great sword attack!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.990
Damage check!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.260
We pirates have the luck of the devil!

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:32.280
I got heal trigger!

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:35.300
I add +5000 to Nightmist's power!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.720
And heal 1 point of damage!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.400
Marron gives a boost!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.720
Gordon attacks!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.560
I defend with Nightmist!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.660
My turn is over.

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.960
I couldn't do more than 1 point of damage...

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.840
With luck, I only took 1 point of damage 
this turn... but I can't underestimate him.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.500
He's different than last time.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:17.260
Look at Gouki! He can't believe it!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.540
They each have 3 damage...

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:22.720
Aichi, you've managed to 
hold the line all this time.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:27.640
He's improved a bit, don't you think?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.120
Not really.

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.560
What do you think, Kai?!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.350
Aichi's gotten a little better, hasn't he?!

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:35.190
Y'know?!

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.400
Yep! Yep!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.520
All right: So far, we've got a tie!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:45.630
It's a good showdown! A captivating battle!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:49.300
In fact, this final match of the final fight 
of the regional tournament is a-poppin'!

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:53.580
Even me, MC Mya -- I'm so 
excited, I can't contain myself!

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.840
Waiting Room
Ultra-rare

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.870
But I ask you, who can sit 
here and <i>not</i> be fired up?!

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:01.400
It really is captivating, isn't it?

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:02.580
Right?!

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.300
Huh? Have I caught a cold?

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:19.080
Up 'til now, this fight's been so-so.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.320
But!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.190
It isn't up to the level of 
a fight at nationals yet!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:30.750
Starting now, though, I'm gonna 
teach you the real power of pirates,

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.620
the pirates who sailed through the 
watery wilderness of nationals!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.960
Here I go!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.460
I call Knight Spirit!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.520
I activate the skill of Spirit Exceed!

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.970
I move Samurai Spirit and 
Knight Spirit to the Soul!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:52.220
When the Vanguard is grade 2,

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:55.130
Spirit Exceed's skill lets it 
take over the Vanguard position!

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:58.810
Dead soul, materialize in this mortal world!

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.560
Superior Ride!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:03.280
Spirit Exceed!

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:08.430
A grade 3 came from the Drop Zone?!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:14.480
What, did you think Nightmist was the only 
denizen of the deep that could be resurrected?!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.060
I think I've told you before...

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:18.650
Pirates can be resurrected 
any number of times!

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:23.220
It's starting... Gouki's 
Infinite Resurrection Hell!

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.900
Anyone who gets caught by 
Gouki's trademark maneuver...

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:30.090
...has absolutely no chance 
of bouncing back, ka-boom!

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:33.510
If you'd won, Kaoru, we wouldn't 
even need to be standing here!

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:34.800
Right, ka-boom...

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:37.980
Guiding Zombie moves to the rear.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:41.740
I summon one more Spirit Exceed here!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.840
Raise the sails, you scalawags!

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:49.290
Show him the pirate spirit!

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.260
There are two grade 3's in the front row!

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.920
He's powered up to the max!

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:02.600
Can Aichi withstand this attack?!

00:22:03.810 --> 00:22:05.140
Aichi...

00:22:07.780 --> 00:22:09.290
Brother...

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:53.550
Gouki is really strong!

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:55.120
How long can I hold out?!

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:56.710
Aichi, have you heard this before?

00:23:56.710 --> 00:23:58.860
"The best defense is a good offense."

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:00.290
On the other hand, a defensive fight...

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:00.910
You lose.

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.010
Oh, that's right! If I lose...

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:04.790
The team loses.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.750
Kai, Misaki, Kamui...

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.160
That's right! I decided to 
do my best for everyone!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:12.660
Kai, everyone... Watch me!

00:24:12.660 --> 00:24:14.860
Next time: The Holy Dragon Descends

00:24:14.860 --> 00:24:16.320
I'll picture it...

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:18.690
Me winning this fight!
